  "Endorsed by the Institute for Human Resource Professionals (IHRP), awarding Skills Badges in Fair and Progressive Practices": "Institute for Human Resource Professionals (IHRP) の承認を受け、公正かつ進歩的な慣行に関するスキルバッジを付与します",
